========================================================================
BambooKit Enhancements
========================================================================
BambooKit extends the OpenCode core with:
1. BambooKit Cloud Control Plane authentication and multi-user workspace sync.
2. Cryptographic Ed25519 device registration and pairing.
3. Android remote control bridge and mobile approval hub.
4. Cross-device telemetry broadcasting and session synchronization.

